      "id": "claim_abb6459621054ee39c84a7f149c464fa",
      "statement": "src/lib/supabase/client.ts's createClient() builds an unmemoized createBrowserClient for Client Components, while src/lib/supabase/server.ts's createClient() builds a createServerClient bound to next/headers cookies and is wrapped in React cache() so one request reuses a single client instance across layout, page, and action calls.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/lib/supabase/client.ts",
