      "statement": "src/app/(app)/layout.tsx is the top-level access gate: it calls the memoized server createClient() and supabase.auth.getClaims(), redirecting to /login when data?.claims is missing; this getClaims() check, not the proxy's session refresh, is the trusted authorization boundary.",
